    {
        "text": "These munitions factories are all empty.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rockrock"
    },
    {
        "text": "We hauled away two production lines and tore down the others.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Feist"
    },
    {
        "text": "The situation was dire. We didn't know how long we had until the Sarkaz mercenaries caught on to what we were up to in the factories. Otherwise, we could've taken even more equipment.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Feist"
    },
    {
        "text": "Highbury... This new industrial district feels rather different from the old district I was in.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rockrock"
    },
    {
        "text": "In Sudean, we were more like spanners, hammering away to knock together everything at all costs. But here... these production lines... I don't know. Maybe you guys are more like gears.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rockrock"
    },
    {
        "text": "Turning ever so stably day in and day out.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rockrock"
    },
    {
        "text": "We're used to it. That's how shocking human adaptability is.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Feist"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_runstop",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4040_rockr_1#11$1",
        "duration": 0.7
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4072_ironmn_1#4$1",
        "duration": 0.7
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4072_ironmn_1#4$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Found it. It's here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Feist"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4040_rockr_1#11$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why are there symbols carved on the collection boxes?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rockrock"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4072_ironmn_1#4$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Years ago, our workshop used these as codewords to let each other know when to slack off. Never did I imagine they would one day come in handy.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Feist"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4040_rockr_1#12$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Looks like workers everywhere just want to catch a breather, no matter the cost.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rockrock"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4072_ironmn_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Let's see. Patto reorganized most of the Self-Salvation Corps from the other districts.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Feist"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Highbury safehouse was ambushed too, but a few of the pipelines deeper into the plate that's used as rest stops weren't discovered.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Feist"
    },
    {
        "text": "They should be there.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Feist"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_drone",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_424_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_424_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm back~",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rock-18"
    },
    {
        "text": "I've marked the positions of all the Sarkaz sentries. There's not a whole lot of them. Looks like all the manpower in the city is either headed to the frontlines or followed the others.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rock-18"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4040_rockr_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Closure... I still can't say I agree with you installing your voice banks on my drones.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rockrock"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_424_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey, don't forget I helped upgrade this drone of yours!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rock-18"
    },
    {
        "text": "Alright, enough chit-chat. I just heard from Ascalon that some of our communications systems might have been compromised by some Victorian duke.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rock-18"
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't really buy that they can hack us all the way through, but just to be safe, I'm gonna run a whole security audit.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rock-18"
    },
    {
        "text": "Feist, have you confirmed where the rendezvous point is?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rock-18"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4072_ironmn_1#4$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's confirmed.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Feist"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_424_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Awesome. Let's see...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rock-18"
    },
    {
        "text": "We may have Shining as our super bodyguard, but she still has to take care of the wounded. So, avoid fighting at all costs, got it?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rock-18"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4072_ironmn_1#4$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Got it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Feist"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_424_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "You guys go on ahead and make contact with the remaining Self-Salvation Corps fighters first. Clovisia and I will work on the evacuation\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rock-18"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4040_rockr_1#11$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4072_ironmn_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Let's go, Rockrock.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Feist"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4040_rockr_1#11$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Er... right.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rockrock"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4072_ironmn_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "What's the matter?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Feist"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4040_rockr_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, nothing...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rockrock"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4040_rockr_1#7$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "I was just thinking... was Highbury always this quiet?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rockrock"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4072_ironmn_1#11$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Going by the temperature in the air, there's no furnace burning in the neighborhood.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Feist"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4072_ironmn_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "That isn't a good sign. We need to act fast.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Feist"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
