    {
        "text": "Who's there?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Feist"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
        "volume": 0.7
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_660_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "musicvolume",
        "volume": 0.6,
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4072_ironmn_1#4$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_660_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Feist, it's me!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Londinium Worker"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4072_ironmn_1#4$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Tommy, you're here!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Feist"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4072_ironmn_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "You should've waited for us down there. The Sarkaz army has just cleared out our safe houses. There might still be patrols up here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Feist"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_660_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "I-I know... We suffered pretty heavy losses. Day broke his arm, too. Catherine gave him first aid.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Londinium Worker"
    },
    {
        "text": "How much longer until the rest of your group gets here?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Londinium Worker"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4072_ironmn_1#4$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "They should already have left. Don't worry. There's a professional doctor among them. She will take care of his arm.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Feist"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_660_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "A-Alright.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Londinium Worker"
    },
    {
        "text": "Our people are all at the lower level of Maintenance Access K13.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Londinium Worker"
    },
    {
        "text": "I heard... the Self-Salvation Corps are going to evacuate from Londinium?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Londinium Worker"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4072_ironmn_1#9$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Feist"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4072_ironmn_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Only for the time being.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Feist"
    },
    {
        "text": "We will be back, Tommy. We're the Londinium Citizens' Self-Salvation Corps.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Feist"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4072_ironmn_1#8$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "it's just that we need to get our wounded somewhere safe... and there are none in Londinium.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Feist"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_660_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Alright.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Londinium Worker"
    },
    {
        "text": "Now head on down. Catherine keeps it to herself, but we can all tell she's worried sick about you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Londinium Worker"
    },
    {
        "text": "Have you heard about what happened to Norport? Good gracious, the Sarkaz plucked the whole plate up and tossed it out of the city!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Londinium Worker"
    },
    {
        "text": "I heard that flying fortress even destroyed the a duke's high-speed warship... A high-speed warship!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Londinium Worker"
    },
    {
        "text": "War has broken out, Feist, but I've never truly experienced it before...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Londinium Worker"
    },
    {
        "text": "I used to think that joining the Self-Salvation Corps would be no different than before. I thought I'd be standing in front of the assembly line, turning screws, and the only difference would be that the weapons go to you instead.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Londinium Worker"
    },
    {
        "text": "This... This is our home.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Londinium Worker"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4072_ironmn_1#4$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Of course, Londinium's our home, too.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Feist"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_660_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "We belong here and nowhere else, right?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Londinium Worker"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
