    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4087_ines_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "If you ask me, I think I've shown more than enough good faith already.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_867_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hardly unexpected. We, too, have noticed the Sarkaz's secret transportation network for some time now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Trilby Asher'"
    },
    {
        "text": "But it's true that there are certain details that are worth getting to the bottom of, and we will continue our investigation with a focus on these areas.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Trilby Asher'"
    },
    {
        "text": "And I have a decent guess as to who is behind... some of these events.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Trilby Asher'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4087_ines_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I hope you will share the results of your continued investigation with us.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_867_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Of course, just as I previously promised.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Trilby Asher'"
    },
    {
        "text": "Rhodes Island's response is fast. Your terminals' signals have already been re-encrypted.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Trilby Asher'"
    },
    {
        "text": "If the opportunity ever arises, I would love to meet your engineer, Closure.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Trilby Asher'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4087_ines_1#3$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "She might not like you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_867_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I must say, for a pharmaceutical corporation, your company is home to a variety of talents.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Trilby Asher'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4087_ines_1#13$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_407_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_867_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "That said, Her Grace has never been one to refuse new friends in lieu of making enemies.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Trilby Asher'"
    },
    {
        "text": "Not to mention that Her Grace and Alexandrina are related by blood. She is more than willing to care for her young relative.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Trilby Asher'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_407_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Please do let her know how appreciative I am of her looking out for me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_867_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Your Royal Highness, I may yet call you so out of respect, but this does not represent my position whatsoever.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Trilby Asher'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_407_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "You can choose to call me Siege.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_867_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Victoria is a heavy burden, Your Royal Highness. It is nowhere nearly as vivid and vibrant as it seems on the surface.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Trilby Asher'"
    },
    {
        "text": "The return of a certain person\u2014no matter who she is or what she calls herself\u2014is of no benefit to the nation.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Trilby Asher'"
    },
    {
        "text": "If, under certain specific circumstances, that person were to use her identity and influence inappropriately, she might even do the nation harm.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Trilby Asher'"
    },
    {
        "text": "That is my personal viewpoint.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Trilby Asher'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_407_1#10$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Then you'd best keep your personal viewpoint to yourself.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm sure you know that my amenability of this peace between us does not equate to a tolerance of your cliches.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_867_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Your Royal Highness, there is no reason for this animosity between us. I am simply following orders, and I've more than demonstrated my goodwill within the bounds of my responsibilities.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Trilby Asher'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_407_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Then perhaps your demonstration hasn't been very clear. That, or our definitions of 'goodwill' are different.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_867_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wouldn't my suggestion that you should make your way to Norport count? If I am not wrong, you have a friend who is currently trapped there.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Trilby Asher'"
    },
    {
        "text": "I thought you would see that I am very much putting myself in your shoes as I advocate for this partnership. I am doing you a favor.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Trilby Asher'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_407_1#5$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_867_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "My goal is to obtain the schematics. You are free to do anything else you deem necessary, including rescuing your friend.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Trilby Asher'"
    },
    {
        "text": "If you would offer that blade in your hand, I could even offer my personal assistance.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Trilby Asher'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_407_1#10$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "You can save your disgusting hypocrisy.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "text": "Listen, I don't so much as want to think about what you and that duke you work for are scheming.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "text": "Stay out of my way, and get out of my sight.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "text": "And you better remember this. For what happened to Allerdale, you and I and your master still have a score to settle.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_407_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "And you'd better believe it will be settled.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_867_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Of course.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Trilby Asher'"
    },
    {
        "text": "I just got word that the Duke's special response team has already made all the preparations necessary for you to evacuate Londinium and board Norport Borough.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Trilby Asher'"
    },
    {
        "text": "Let us be off.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Trilby Asher'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_394_1#19$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mr. 'Trilby Asher,' since the moment I first saw you, when I realized just how solid of a grasp the Duke has on Rhodes Island's communications, I've been thinking...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "You've always been able to do this, haven't you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_867_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "What do you mean?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Trilby Asher'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_394_1#19$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "You've always known what everyone is up to, whether it's us, the Sarkaz, or the Self-Salvation Corps.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_867_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's nowhere nearly as simple or comprehensive as you would imagine.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Trilby Asher'"
    },
    {
        "text": "We've always found it very tricky to stay thoroughly informed on the Sarkaz, especially certain men of the Royal Court. Many of my colleagues have lost their lives because of this.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Trilby Asher'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_394_1#19$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "But you've always had a good understanding of the tides.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_394_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why did you... and especially the dukes behind you let things turn out like this?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_867_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Kazdel Regent is a formidable opponent, and my guess is even old Wellington would admit this. The Kazdel Military Commission's technology and equipment leave a deep impression.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Trilby Asher'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_394_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "When coming from the executor of a Victorian duke's will, this just sounds like sarcasm.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Based on our analysis, Theresis may be formidable, but his strength alone is not enough for Victoria to fall to such lows, where it finds itself at the mercy of others.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_394_1#20$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "And now I get it. You chose to do nothing.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "You simply watched as the flames of war engulfed your country.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_867_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Amiya, the little leader of Rhodes Island. How old are you? Fifteen? Sixteen? You are still a child, even.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Trilby Asher'"
    },
    {
        "text": "You despise blood and war, but let me clarify this. We are not very fond of these things either.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Trilby Asher'"
    },
    {
        "text": "But to us, the objective of war is never war itself. War is an extension of politics. The Sarkaz needs a war to unite themselves, and Victoria doesn't necessary lack the need for one.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Trilby Asher'"
    },
    {
        "text": "However, around whom we unite is worthy of discussion.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Trilby Asher'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_394_1#20$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "And for just that, you\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_867_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "This is very important. It is far more important than you could imagine.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Trilby Asher'"
    },
    {
        "text": "War is cruel. Suffering and death follow in its wake. It exposes our barest, truest forms to one another. It tears off all disguises.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Trilby Asher'"
    },
    {
        "text": "At certain stages of history's ever-forward march, we need this kind of honesty. All of us do.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Trilby Asher'"
    },
    {
        "text": "Now make your preparations, Rhodes Island. It is time for us to depart.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Trilby Asher'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
