    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_657_1#6$1",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_647_1#4$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Molly! They caught you, too?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Golding"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_647_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Lettou, she's just a teacher. The children in school still need to be cared for.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Golding"
    },
    {
        "text": "You have already destroyed what you came to destroy. Must you drag even more innocents into this mess?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Golding"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_649_1#9$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're here, Your Excellency.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lt. Colonel Lettou"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_657_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Banshee came looking for trouble with one of us again.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Molly'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_649_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I will send a unit to provide support.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lt. Colonel Lettou"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_657_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "No need. Taking a walk with him isn't so bad.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Molly'"
    },
    {
        "text": "You should go to the Old Red-Eye. He had just opened a new bottle of wine, waiting for you, and we have already grown tired of his stories of yesteryear.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Molly'"
    },
    {
        "text": "You are a much better listener than us.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Molly'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_649_1#9$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014Understood. Please pardon me, then.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lt. Colonel Lettou"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_649_1#9$1",
        "afrom": 1,
        "ato": 0,
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_647_1#4$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_657_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "You...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Golding"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_647_1#4$1",
        "focus": "none"
    },
    {
        "text": "Golding's throat has never felt this dry. The person in front of her looks and acts exactly the same as the Molly she remembers, down to the tiniest movements."
    },
    {
        "text": "She is always frowning a little, watching every move of the mischievous children. At suppertime, she would hand out bread to everyone and chastise anyone who hasn't washed hands."
    },
    {
        "text": "Her expression is the same as ever, but for some reason..."
    },
    {
        "text": "The drop of sweat dripping down Golding's back seeps into her clothes."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_657_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Lance scratched his thumb again yesterday, but don't worry. I've put on some ointment.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Molly'"
    },
    {
        "text": "He's always such a handful.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Molly'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_647_1#4$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "What... are you...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Golding"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_657_1#7$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "The teacher has made it back to the school already. She will take good care of the children, I'm sure.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Molly'"
    },
    {
        "text": "How about a chat?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Molly'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_657_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Relax. It's just a chat. If you still don't feel comfortable, we can continue to use the identity of the owner of this appearance around you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Molly'"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why don't we talk about the weather first, or perhaps the children's studies? There is the play too, Lady Golding. Merely thinking about it brings tears to my eyes.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Molly'"
    },
    {
        "text": "The children have all grown so big in just the blink of an eye.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Molly'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_647_1#3$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 8,
        "ystrength": 10,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "Enough. Stop talking to me like you're Molly! Stop using that face, you monster!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Golding"
    },
    {
        "text": "What... What do you want?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Golding"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_657_1#1$1",
        "focus": "all"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_657_1#1$1",
        "afrom": 1,
        "ato": 0,
        "duration": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_humanchange"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_426_1#8$1",
        "afrom": 0,
        "ato": 1,
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_426_1#8$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Would you like a cup of tea? Lettou has pretty fine tastes, and his tea here is exquisite.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Damazti Cluster"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_647_1#4$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Golding"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_426_1#8$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "We finally have a satisfying outcome for all the missions Theresis handed us. Now, we can take a short break.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Damazti Cluster"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_647_1#10$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "How long have you been around me...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Golding"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_426_1#8$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Not as long as you think. Can we skip the boring work talk, though?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Damazti Cluster"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's break time right now. We want to do something that we are truly interested in.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Damazti Cluster"
    },
    {
        "text": "For example\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Damazti Cluster"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_426_1#10$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "We want to know what you think about this era, and your conclusions around all this.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Damazti Cluster"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_647_1#10$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't understand.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Golding"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_647_1#3$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "You... You used me to destroy the Self-Salvation Corps. I should have no more value to you anymore.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Golding"
    },
    {
        "text": "I... Damn it! I handed all this out myself...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Golding"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_426_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't blame yourself. This is no big deal at all. We had all kinds of ways to locate the Self-Salvation Corps' stronghold. You are not the only lead we have.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Damazti Cluster"
    },
    {
        "text": "This may sound a little hurtful, but you aren't even the most important one.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Damazti Cluster"
    },
    {
        "text": "But we do indeed have a little bit of interest on you. We enjoyed your work and chatting with you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Damazti Cluster"
    },
    {
        "text": "So, let's have a chat together. There is nothing more to this. It's just a conversation.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Damazti Cluster"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_426_1#2$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "We've had conversations like this many times. With countless of identities. With countless others.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Damazti Cluster"
    },
    {
        "text": "But we are still confused. We still don't want to give up any chances that could lead to an answer.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Damazti Cluster"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_426_1#10$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Lady Golding, how do you think\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Damazti Cluster"
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014we should live?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Damazti Cluster"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
